# the site is generated: the packages, the indexes and the storefront pages are
# all products of ./refresh.sh and are published to gh-pages, not tracked here.
# what is tracked is everything needed to rebuild them, and the ledger of what
# has already gone out, without which the immutability check cannot work from a
# fresh clone
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!repo.conf
!refresh.sh
!publish.sh
!published.json
!depiction-template.html
!index-template.html
!CydiaIcon.png
!assets/
!assets/*
!tools/
!tools/*.py
